dynamically, and this package does not contain them, but code from the Qt
headers is compiled into the binary. Qt is used under the GNU Lesser General
Public License, version 3. qt6-base and qt6-declarative install the texts of
that licence and of the GNU General Public License, version 3, under
/usr/share/licenses/qt6-base/ and /usr/share/licenses/qt6-declarative/.

